# Brief signal description — grounded and complete

## The rule

Every **`why_routing`** / **`signal_summary`** cell in the signals table must let a manager understand **what happened** from that sentence alone — without opening the source URL.

This is **not** a request for AI “analysis” or opinion. It is a **factual one-liner** built from collect evidence.

## Required shape

```
[optional context prefix] {what the competitor did/published — concrete facts} → {short routing implication}
```

### Must include (from collect data)

At least **one concrete fact** from, in order of preference:

1. `evidence_snippet`
2. `snippet`
3. `entities` (article titles, prices, role groups, integration names, etc.)
4. `headline` + page kind (`metadata.page_kind` or `source`)

### Must not be

- A generic routing label alone (“pricing or packaging page update”, “careers signal”, “product-shaped signal”)
- Classification name with no substance (“PMM / channel-building”)
- Parity jargon without saying what changed on the competitor side

### Good

> Pricing/packaging page update — values spotted: $4; 46% AI tour conversion vs 19% non-AI — themes: voice ai, crm → Compare to Core all-in disclosure before chasing packaging.

> 6 article(s) on index — latest: "AI Is Changing the Way Your Renters Search", "Fee Transparency: How All-In Pricing…" → PMM/positioning — no engineering PRD unless promoted manually.

### Bad

> Pricing or packaging page update — validate against Core fee disclosure before chasing.

## Implementation

| Layer | Owner |
|-------|--------|
| Intel publish | `lib/briefSignalAnalysis.js` → `buildSignalAnalysis()` |
| Table rows | `lib/briefClassify.js` → `buildSignalsTableRows()` sets `why_routing` + `signal_summary` |
| Backfill | `scripts/reanalyze-signals-table.js --drop <id>` |
| Agent publish | Must preserve or enrich grounded facts; may add parity/prototype detail after scan |

## Display

- **Morningbrief chat table:** up to ~220 chars (see `briefFeed.js`)
- **Viewer:** full string, no truncation

## The test

A manager reading only the Why column can answer: **Who? What changed? Why is it in this bucket?** If not, the row fails this rule.

## Origin

Established 2026-06-15 after manager review: generic template strings replaced real collect evidence in the brief table.
